            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14">
              <num>14</num>
              <heading>After subsection 27B(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__subsec-4A">
                  <num>4A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p><role refersTo="#secretary">The Secretary</role> may make an approval given under subsection (4) subject to conditions specified in the approval.</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__subsec-4B">
                  <num>4B</num>
                  <content>
                    <p><role refersTo="#secretary">The Secretary</role> may, by writing, revoke an approval given under subsection (4) if <role refersTo="#secretary">the Secretary</role> is satisfied that the holder of the approval has breached any conditions of the approval.</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__subsec-4C">
                  <num>4C</num>
                  <content>
                    <p><role refersTo="#secretary">The Secretary</role> must give notice of the revocation to the holder. The notice must specify the day the revocation takes effect.</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-14__qstr-1__subsec-4D">
                  <num>4D</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(4D)	Subsection (4B) does not limit subsection 33(3) of the <i>Acts Interpretation Act 1901</i>.</p>
                  </content>
